    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41d53a06a5f6b94f698a2aa0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两场模拟赛的结果皆是败北。\n但是……那时候，在绿茵上奔跑的她的前方，\n的确开辟出了通向未来的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bfbfd759610ad109084b534ccc0f09e7de468a08784a4d91b26a4a73123b04e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
