      "uid": "zhcn:1c8fc23c1758540fe9e66974",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "确实，早已是古马级的景致前辈经验丰富。\n而且还有过海外远征的经验\n有着绝佳的应变能力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2626f18366ff1bbbdfc060c49f3ef37a50fdff60854546b9f57003a060726ede",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143114.json",
      "json_path": [
