      "uid": "zhcn:45f66959863bf0e10c8d24a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我深感同意地点点头。\n要在有限时间里达成目标，\n现在需要的是更浓厚的经验。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3887606fe6f02606b8afe0fd25c27c78a256ee103be69862674d7612db93282",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
