    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869977158b39f8a10209c596",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有，在7月宣布挑战『凯旋门赏』，\n如今正意气风发迈向海外的\n中山庆典――",
      "source_fingerprint": "7439130f1be0cc9d677972e6ca251643f86de245b11871cc1dfb59a19548b7c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143114.json",
      "json_path": [
