      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我觉得现在突破自己的身心极限，\n能引领我走向下一个阶段。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d24a483f2963d3a92892b6851bf5a0a6a8fdbbec36f361afdcce6bde9ed55401",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1cc10b6f8300eb9e5eb2d96",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使是模拟赛，也会大幅消耗身心。\n一般比赛间隔会保持至少两周到三周以上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4425cea05e0c1231045772929ae87306b44e135347ac44f970cd89ea8d2ac24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1143/storytimeline_501143114.json",
      "json_path": [
